## About C.A.P.I.T.O.L.

**Civic Artificial Programming & Intelligence for Tracking, Organizing & Lawmaking**

A privacy-focused, local-first AI assistant for legislative analysis. Built for legislative professionals working with public domain information, in the spirit of Ollama and other open-source AI tools.

### Key Features
- 🔒 100% Local & Private - Your data never leaves your computer
- 🚀 Powered by Ollama - Free, open-source LLM runtime
- 📚 RAG-Enhanced - Intelligent document analysis
- 🎯 Legislative Focus - Purpose-built for policy work

### Credits
- **Created by:** Dylan Carpowich (Arts by Dylan)
- **Website:** artsbydylan.com
- **Development:** Vibe-coded with AI assistance from Google and Microsoft
- **Built with:** Electron, React, Python, Ollama
- **Inspired by:** The open-source AI community

### Public Domain Mission
Designed for legislative professionals who work with public domain information. This tool respects the open nature of civic data and contributes to transparent, accessible governance.
